Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.96,0:00:01.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,光明与黑暗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.06,0:00:03.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在陷入一片混乱的战国时代
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.90,0:00:06.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了四魂之玉因缘际会聚在一起的伙伴们
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.26,0:00:07.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,穿越五百年的时光
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.83,0:00:11.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在最后仅存的四魂之玉碎片引导着各自的命运
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.14,0:00:13.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,战国时代的传奇故事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.54,0:00:14.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.94,0:00:16.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,受到那群妖鸟袭击的城堡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.71,0:00:19.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落究竟在那里隐藏了什么样惊人的秘密呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.44,0:00:21.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且 在守卫城堡的人群中
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.81,0:00:24.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟然出现了珊瑚的弟弟琥珀的身影
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.92,0:00:28.81,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You can now dream （勇敢的梦想） 挥起舞动{\fad(300,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.95,0:00:35.68,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I'm in a world （暧昧的世界） 奋力冲出吧{\fad(0,500)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.40,0:00:48.93,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,面对忧郁的现实生活{\fad(0,100)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.38,0:00:55.11,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不断在心中自我成长的勇者
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.28,0:01:01.34,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨夜的梦境及梦中残留的影像{\fad(0,50)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.42,0:01:06.32,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,断断续续提醒我「勇往直前」
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.56,0:01:14.16,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,破茧而出的我及含苞待放的未来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.33,0:01:18.93,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道你就将它禁锢起来吗{\fad(0,50)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.37,0:01:23.30,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You can now dream （勇敢的梦想） 挥起舞动
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.44,0:01:27.81,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Go and try （不顾一切的去尝试） 无尽的烦恼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.95,0:01:32.28,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与你天长地久永不分离
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.42,0:01:35.25,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Do you need to cry （同样的哭泣） 和孤独相伴
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.39,0:01:39.78,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Show me a day fight （直接应战） 每当伤心流泪的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.92,0:01:46.89,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让它成为坚定不移的梦想吧{\fad(0,1000)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.39,0:02:11.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要杀了奈落？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.33,0:02:13.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 母亲大人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.07,0:02:16.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自从跟那个家伙有所瓜葛之后就没有什么好事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.07,0:02:18.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老是出现一些碍手碍脚的麻烦事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.90,0:02:22.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就连帮母亲大人冲淡身上毒素的人血
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.67,0:02:24.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也反而变得越来越难收集了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.88,0:02:28.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最不能原谅的是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.81,0:02:31.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟然让我阿毘公主
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.42,0:02:33.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卷入了他们半妖之间无聊的争斗之中
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.49,0:02:35.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.02,0:02:39.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么你不如试着去攻打那个城堡看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.02,0:02:40.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,城堡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.43,0:02:44.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一个非常可疑的城堡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.10,0:02:48.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恐怕跟奈落有着很深的关系
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.70,0:02:50.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,母亲大人 那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.14,0:02:54.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚好跟那个圣大人差不多时候出现的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.87,0:02:55.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是那个家伙吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.88,0:02:58.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.49,0:03:09.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖鸟烧起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.13,0:03:24.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,圣大人终于回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.77,0:03:26.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救…救命啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.44,0:03:30.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是布下结界的那个家伙吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.41,0:03:32.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了他
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.56,0:03:49.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得…得救了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.66,0:03:52.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的鸟全都消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.76,0:03:54.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 这到底是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.63,0:03:58.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自从遇上奈落之后就一直遇到碍事的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.67,0:04:07.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么看来那个圣大人好像是奈落的眼中钉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.71,0:04:11.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落释放出手下的妖怪布满了整个天空
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.12,0:04:14.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到处寻找那个圣大人的藏身之地
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.39,0:04:20.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经派出鸟儿去调查这样的情况
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.39,0:04:23.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结果发现只有一个地方
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.33,0:04:25.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些妖怪完全没有接近
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.60,0:04:28.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是一个人类的城堡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.70,0:04:33.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落的妖怪就像没有看见城堡一样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.04,0:04:35.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从上空飞了过去
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.34,0:04:38.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定是因为这个地方跟奈落有着关系
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.11,0:04:41.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以才没有必要去搜查
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.85,0:04:45.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你试着去袭击那个城堡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.55,0:04:48.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看奈落到底在那个地方隐藏了什么秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.79,0:04:53.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第152话 保护并且夺取
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.30,0:04:59.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,夫人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.13,0:05:02.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您看看少爷睡得很甜呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.14,0:05:05.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.57,0:05:07.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚上也从来不哭闹
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.37,0:05:09.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是一个乖孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.01,0:05:14.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仿佛那天晚上可怕的事件从来没有发生过
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.81,0:05:18.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在我生下这个孩子的那天晚上
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.45,0:05:21.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当时在产房里帮忙的所有人全部都死了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.95,0:05:23.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.76,0:05:27.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像有某个人出现了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.76,0:05:33.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在却想不起来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.90,0:05:42.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之后那个晚上的记忆就越来越淡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.84,0:05:48.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀 不能去那里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.98,0:05:53.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可以进来这里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.28,0:05:54.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.25,0:05:56.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,夫人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.05,0:05:58.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,实在是非常的抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.06,0:06:02.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这孩子是刚来我们这不久的下人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.06,0:06:05.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还没有习惯这个地方的环境
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.43,0:06:06.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.93,0:06:09.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叫他抬起头让我看看他的脸
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.43,0:06:10.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.20,0:06:12.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抬起头来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.00,0:06:13.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.78,0:06:22.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是不是在哪里见过面
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.81,0:06:23.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可能吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.08,0:06:27.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个孩子怎么可能有机会见过夫人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.22,0:06:28.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.02,0:06:29.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.15,0:06:31.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.59,0:06:33.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来是我多心了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.03,0:06:37.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.29,0:06:38.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.05,0:07:02.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,夫人看起来好像是一位很温柔的人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.92,0:07:03.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.99,0:07:06.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且夫人最近刚生了嗣子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.49,0:07:08.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了 真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.13,0:07:14.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.37,0:07:18.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你和神无一起留在那个城堡里
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.64,0:07:19.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,遵命
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.50,0:07:22.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在城堡里面生活 保护好那个婴儿
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.01,0:07:28.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀 要多吃一点
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.21,0:07:29.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.04,0:08:01.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把这些柴搬走了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.55,0:08:03.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.68,0:08:04.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没关系 没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.82,0:08:10.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个城堡好平静
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.12,0:08:13.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很久以前
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.56,0:08:16.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我好像也曾经像这样跟很多人生活在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.56,0:08:22.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然我已经想不起来那是什么时候的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.01,0:08:38.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 一群吸人血的鸟群
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.82,0:08:40.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您知道这件事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.75,0:08:43.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最近好像都在传这件事情
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.32,0:08:45.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们当然也有听说过这个传闻
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.62,0:08:47.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么这附近有吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.32,0:08:49.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从来都没有看过
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.26,0:08:51.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且这里就在城堡的山脚下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.30,0:08:56.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖怪们肯定是不能靠近这里的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.04,0:09:05.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里也不是我们要找的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.21,0:09:06.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这也没办法
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.84,0:09:08.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又没有妖鸟巢穴的线索
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.28,0:09:12.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来我们今天只好先在这里借宿一晚了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.35,0:09:14.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说只好借宿一晚是…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.82,0:09:16.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要去哪里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.69,0:09:19.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帅哥
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.92,0:09:21.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟我们一起玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.66,0:09:24.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也好想玩呀… 但还是算了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.20,0:09:28.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.73,0:09:30.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,受不够教训
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.44,0:09:37.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,白童子这个小鬼没有心脏
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.21,0:09:39.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以不管被怎么四分五裂都不会死
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.69,0:09:49.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙的心脏到底在哪里呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.76,0:09:54.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神乐 你在想什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.96,0:09:56.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少啰唆
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.36,0:09:58.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你总得让我有想的自由吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.77,0:10:03.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.37,0:10:05.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也就是说
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.27,0:10:08.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是那个叫什么鸟之使者阿毘公主吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.38,0:10:13.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神乐 跟在她们后面
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.71,0:10:16.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要监视着就好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.61,0:10:18.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不准你多管闲事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.42,0:10:21.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多管闲事是什么意思啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.99,0:10:22.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.86,0:10:35.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是奈落的毒虫吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.77,0:10:37.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来监视我的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.94,0:10:45.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走着瞧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.12,0:10:59.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个女妖怪… 变成奈落的敌人了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.03,0:11:11.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀 琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.17,0:11:15.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.44,0:11:17.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我听到你在呻吟
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.31,0:11:18.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要紧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.68,0:11:20.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是不是做恶梦了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.05,0:11:24.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是什么样的梦啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.32,0:11:29.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想不起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.15,0:11:31.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喝吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.92,0:11:32.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.16,0:11:39.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感觉好点了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.20,0:11:41.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.50,0:11:45.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接下来要做个好梦喔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.44,0:11:57.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙一开始打呼 其他人就没办法好好睡了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.35,0:12:06.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都好亲切
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.23,0:12:16.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么 不感谢我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.40,0:12:17.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.47,0:12:21.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我奈落把你弟弟的命捡回来的喔
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.54,0:12:27.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀 你怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.21,0:12:28.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么要保护奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.28,0:12:31.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我让他忘记了全部的事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.38,0:12:33.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关于你的事 还有琥珀所有的记忆
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.22,0:12:37.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.89,0:12:39.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在在做什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.40,0:12:47.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,洗得好舒服喔
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.26,0:12:48.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚你也去洗吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.57,0:12:57.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是阿毘公主的妖鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.04,0:12:59.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朝城堡的方向去了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.91,0:13:05.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀你连父母的样子都不记得了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.68,0:13:08.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,战争中失去父母的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.52,0:13:09.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.89,0:13:12.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.46,0:13:16.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是还好你来到这城堡和大家在一块
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.26,0:13:22.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这里工作的每一个人就像是一家人感情很好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.21,0:13:32.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救命啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.55,0:13:43.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是妖鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.59,0:13:44.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,危险啊 快躲起来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.63,0:13:53.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好…好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.60,0:13:55.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥…琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.07,0:13:58.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝对不能出去外面 知道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.84,0:14:00.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.08,0:14:12.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀 去保护那个婴儿
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.62,0:14:21.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,夫人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.13,0:14:24.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会有事的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.76,0:14:26.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有这个孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.63,0:14:28.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,城堡里所有的人都会保护我们的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.87,0:14:31.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算是牺牲自己的生命
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.64,0:14:35.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些妖鸟出动了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.64,0:14:37.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们正在袭击城堡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.28,0:14:39.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有四魂之玉碎片的气息
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.64,0:14:40.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.01,0:14:42.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且那个是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.38,0:14:43.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀身上的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.55,0:14:44.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀在城堡里
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.88,0:14:46.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个气息一定是他没错
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.15,0:14:50.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀 你又受到了奈落的命令吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.15,0:14:52.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次你又打算做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.67,0:15:06.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀 去保护那个婴儿
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.27,0:15:08.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保护嗣子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.54,0:15:09.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别让它们靠近屋内
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.78,0:15:16.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道这些妖鸟是因为知道婴儿在这里而来的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.22,0:15:24.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在这个地方干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.56,0:15:27.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你只是个下人的小孩
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.39,0:15:28.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点找个地方躲起来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.09,0:15:30.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.33,0:15:32.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们保护了我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.53,0:15:38.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.44,0:15:41.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到了城堡之后就直接去找琥珀吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.34,0:15:43.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖鸟让我来对付
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.72,0:15:52.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快去啊 珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.95,0:15:53.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快去
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.85,0:15:54.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.72,0:15:56.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉碎片的气息在那个方向
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.22,0:15:58.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.19,0:16:01.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.73,0:16:04.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.60,0:16:13.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 又是你吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.27,0:16:16.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿毘公主 你还没受够教训啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.74,0:16:17.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.77,0:16:20.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是奈落的敌人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.21,0:16:22.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你为什么要保护这个城堡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.95,0:16:24.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.25,0:16:25.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个城堡…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.72,0:16:28.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难不成这里跟奈落有什么关系吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.89,0:16:31.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是我要来证明的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.25,0:16:35.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然现在出来抵抗的就只有人类
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.66,0:16:37.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.39,0:16:40.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是已经跟奈落联手了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.46,0:16:41.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开什么玩笑啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.90,0:16:44.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是那家伙一厢情愿而已
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.27,0:16:46.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说你跟奈落已经闹翻啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.50,0:16:48.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你就不要再插手多管闲事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.31,0:16:51.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落那个家伙由我们来打倒
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.24,0:16:53.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我先来解决你这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.61,0:16:55.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我滚回去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.82,0:17:01.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来跟奈落扯上关系唯一的好处
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.05,0:17:04.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概就是这把三叉戟的结界吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.56,0:17:07.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.69,0:17:10.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瘴气
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.09,0:17:12.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.26,0:17:14.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有这个作用啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.40,0:17:16.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接招
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.10,0:17:18.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少得意了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.71,0:17:27.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让阿毘公主跟犬夜叉两个人互相厮杀
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.21,0:17:29.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,似乎不是奈落计划的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.45,0:17:32.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个城堡里到底有什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.89,0:17:44.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖鸟烧起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.70,0:17:54.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,夫人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.94,0:17:55.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,着火了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.81,0:17:57.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么办呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.01,0:18:05.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,夫人 您快点到外头去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.02,0:18:08.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再待在这里的话会被烧死的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.22,0:18:11.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是那个叫琥珀的孩子吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.02,0:18:13.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.42,0:18:15.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是外头有妖怪啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.06,0:18:17.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一点都没错
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.56,0:18:20.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎么样我都必须保护这个孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.46,0:18:22.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为他是很重要的嗣子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.43,0:18:23.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您不用担心
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.70,0:18:25.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会用自己的生命来保护他的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.40,0:18:27.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点 往这边
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.64,0:18:29.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.02,0:18:44.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好难受
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.02,0:18:46.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,振作一点
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.77,0:19:01.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,夫人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.81,0:19:02.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.57,0:19:04.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都没事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.28,0:19:07.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.31,0:19:10.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这孩子救了我们
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.21,0:19:12.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.25,0:19:15.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀 我要谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.19,0:19:18.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.36,0:19:20.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,必须让夫人他们到安全一点的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.79,0:19:23.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀 你就待在夫人的身边
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.69,0:19:24.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.23,0:19:25.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖鸟又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.84,0:19:35.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你帮了我大忙 琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.81,0:19:37.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,往那边了 大家快点
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.51,0:19:41.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我问你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.55,0:19:43.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是在哪里学会这些本领的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.08,0:19:45.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是看着别人模仿的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.05,0:19:47.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看起来好像是驱魔师
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.82,0:19:50.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又来了 大家
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.15,0:19:51.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托掩护一下
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.29,0:19:52.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.12,0:19:55.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,驱魔师
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.86,0:19:58.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.16,0:20:02.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看我的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.84,0:20:09.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.84,0:20:12.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以前好像也像这样战斗过
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.54,0:20:14.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟伙伴们一起同心协力
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.55,0:20:18.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.42,0:20:19.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.35,0:20:20.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,半妖
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.14,0:20:41.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,殿下…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.30,0:20:42.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,殿下受到妖鸟的攻击了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.07,0:20:45.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,城堡…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.78,0:20:46.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被攻陷了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.45,0:20:57.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.29,0:21:00.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用担心
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.72,0:21:02.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要紧的 夫人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.29,0:21:07.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀 把婴儿抢过来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.40,0:21:10.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把周遭的人通通杀掉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.50,0:21:12.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀掉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.11,0:21:17.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.81,0:21:21.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,夫人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.91,0:21:25.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们一定…一定会得救的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.09,0:21:34.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀 你在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.97,0:21:46.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干得好 琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.70,0:21:47.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就靠你了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.71,0:21:49.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.21,0:21:55.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀掉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.78,0:21:58.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把周遭的人通通杀掉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.95,0:22:01.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀掉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.99,0:22:13.86,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Brand-New World 全新梦想的起点{\fad(0,200)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.96,0:22:20.84,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朝向目标持续旅程 直到最后{\fad(0,50)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.97,0:22:29.14,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Brand-New Mind 怀抱热情直到下一扇门扉{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.25,0:22:35.45,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冲向未知的世界 快奔驰吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.89,0:22:44.38,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伸手触摸 那微尘般的希望之星{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.49,0:22:53.20,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使勉强握住 横冲直撞的我们想往何处?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.30,0:22:59.40,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保有自我 Let's go and Try 前进吧 使命只有One way{\fad(0,25)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.28,0:23:06.44,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,顺其自然 Do it! Ready? 最后愿望将达成{\fad(50,200)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.55,0:23:13.42,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Brand-New World 全新梦想的起点
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.52,0:23:20.43,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朝向目标持续旅程 直到最后
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.53,0:23:28.60,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Brand-New Mind 怀抱热情直到下一扇门扉
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.77,0:23:35.01,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冲向未知的世界 快奔驰吧{\fad(0,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.13,0:23:52.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我到底是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.63,0:23:55.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丧失了记忆 受到奈落控制的琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.80,0:23:57.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个人是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.14,0:23:59.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然再次相遇却还是想不起姐姐珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.91,0:24:02.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你又做出这种事了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.34,0:24:03.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又做了…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.44,0:24:05.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在阿毘公主与犬夜叉对决的同时
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.81,0:24:08.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,背负着悲伤过去的姐姐跟弟弟也陷入了激战
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.82,0:24:11.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.18,0:24:13.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,命中注定的残酷重逢
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.42,0:24:14.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算死了也没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.95,0:24:16.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那怕要跟他同归于尽
